{"sha": "93d602d57421bce3430b1e87d6fafcf2f02c0658659567c707f80698337bd27f", "body": ["\\begin{method}[由质量求粒子数]\\label{met:g10:the-mole:mass-to-number}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 写出该物质的化学式，", "        并由表中查得其摩尔质量 $M$。", "  \\item 必要时将质量换算为克，然后计算 $n = m / M$。", "  \\item 若需求粒子数，则 $N = n \\times N_A$。", "  \\item 检查数量级：几克小分子约为", "        十分之一摩尔的量级，即约 $10^{22}$ 至 $10^{23}$", "        个粒子。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, box/.style={draw=omDef, very thick,", "    fill=omDef!8, rounded corners=3pt, minimum width=2.9cm,", "    minimum height=1.1cm, align=center}]", "  \\node[box] (m) at (0,0) {质量 $m$\\\\[1pt] (\\si{g})};", "  \\node[box] (n) at (5,0) {物质的量 $n$\\\\[1pt] (\\si{mol})};", "  \\node[box] (N) at (10,0) {粒子数 $N$\\\\[1pt] (个)};", "  \\draw[-{Stealth[length=7pt]}, thick, omProp] ([yshift=4pt]m.east)", "    -- node[above] {$\\div M$} ([yshift=4pt]n.west);", "  \\draw[-{Stealth[length=7pt]}, thick, omProp] ([yshift=-4pt]n.west)", "    -- node[below] {$\\times M$} ([yshift=-4pt]m.east);", "  \\draw[-{Stealth[length=7pt]}, thick, omProp] ([yshift=4pt]n.east)", "    -- node[above] {$\\times N_A$} ([yshift=4pt]N.west);", "  \\draw[-{Stealth[length=7pt]}, thick, omProp] ([yshift=-4pt]N.west)", "    -- node[below] {$\\div N_A$} ([yshift=-4pt]n.east);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 物质的量 $n$ 居中：天平给出 $m$，", "由摩尔质量得到 $n$，再由阿伏伽德罗常数", "得到粒子数。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "", "\\begin{example}[9 克水]\\label{ex:g10:the-mole:nine}", "% ledger: aw:H, aw:O, const:NA", "\\qty{9.0}{g} 水中有多少个分子？$M(\\ce{H2O}) =", "\\qty{18.0}{g/mol}$，故", "\\[", "  n = \\frac{\\qty{9.0}{g}}{\\qty{18.0}{g/mol}} = \\qty{0.50}{mol},", "  \\qquad", "  N = \\qty{0.50}{mol} \\times \\qty{6.02e23}{mol^{-1}}", "    = \\num{3.0e23} \\text{ 个分子。}", "\\]", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[桌上的一摩尔]\\label{ex:g10:the-mole:bench}", "% ledger: rho:water, rho:NaCl, rho:sucrose, rho:Fe, aw:H, aw:O, aw:Na, aw:Cl, aw:C, aw:Fe", "一摩尔水重 \\qty{18.0}{g}，约一汤匙。一摩尔食盐，", "\\qty{58.5}{g}，是一小堆；一摩尔蔗糖重 \\qty{342.0}{g}，可", "装满一个马克杯；一摩尔铁重 \\qty{55.8}{g}，是一个边长略小于", "\\qty{2}{cm} 的立方体。四者所含粒子数相同：", "蔗糖分子只是比水分子重得多，而铁原子", "排列得紧密得多。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=0.62cm, y=0.62cm]", "  % cubes of true volume, drawn to one common scale: side = cube root of V", "  % water 18.09 cm3 -> 2.625 cm; NaCl 26.96 cm3 -> 2.999 cm;", "  % sucrose 216.4 cm3 -> 6.004 cm; Fe 7.09 cm3 -> 1.921 cm", "  \\newcommand{\\cube}[4]{% x, side, fill, label", "    \\pgfmathsetmacro\\d{0.35*#2}", "    \\fill[#3!35, draw=#3!80!black] (#1,0) rectangle ++(#2,#2);", "    \\fill[#3!20, draw=#3!80!black] (#1,#2) -- ++(\\d,\\d) -- ++(#2,0)", "      -- ++(-\\d,-\\d) -- cycle;", "    \\fill[#3!50, draw=#3!80!black] (#1+#2,0) -- ++(\\d,\\d) -- ++(0,#2)", "      -- ++(-\\d,-\\d) -- cycle;", "    \\node[below, align=center] at (#1+#2/2,-0.1) {#4};}", "  \\cube{0}{2.625}{cyan}{water\\\\ \\qty{18.0}{g}\\\\ \\qty{18}{cm^3}}", "  \\cube{4.3}{2.999}{gray}{salt\\\\ \\qty{58.5}{g}\\\\ \\qty{27}{cm^3}}", "  \\cube{9}{6.004}{orange}{sugar\\\\ \\qty{342.0}{g}\\\\ \\qty{216}{cm^3}}", "  \\cube{18}{1.921}{brown}{iron\\\\ \\qty{55.8}{g}\\\\ \\qty{7}{cm^3}}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 水、食盐（氯化钠）、蔗糖和铁各一摩尔，", "按其真实体积画成立方体，所有图形比例相同。", "每份均含 \\num{6.02e23} 个粒子。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{气体：摩尔体积}", "", "\\begin{definition}[摩尔体积]\\label{def:g10:the-mole:molar-volume}", "气体的\\emph{摩尔体积}\\index{摩尔体积} $V_m$ 是指", "在给定温度和压强下，一摩尔该气体所占的体积。", "其单位为升每摩尔（\\si{L/mol}）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[所有气体的摩尔体积相同]\\label{prop:g10:the-mole:avogadro-law}", "% ledger: const:R, const:atm, const:Vm1 (24.1 = R x 293.15 K / 101325 Pa, computed)", "在给定温度和压强下，任何气体一摩尔所占的体积", "几乎相同，与气体种类无关。在 \\qty{20}{\\celsius} 和", "标准大气压强下，", "\\[", "  V_m = \\qty{24.1}{L/mol};", "\\]", "在 \\qty{0}{\\celsius}、同一压强下，$V_m = \\qty{22.4}{L/mol}$。", "体积为 $V$ 的气体，其物质的量为 $n = V / V_m$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "此处不加证明地承认：这是阿伏伽德罗于 1811 年提出的假设，", "现已成为物理定律，而 $V_m$ 的数值由", "物理教材中所学的气体定律推出。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\foreach \\x/\\g/\\m/\\c in {0/{\\ce{H2}}/2.0/cyan, 4/{\\ce{O2}}/32.0/red,", "                           8/{\\ce{CO2}}/44.0/gray} {", "    \\draw[thick, black!60] (\\x,-0.25) -- (\\x,-1.1);", "    \\shade[ball color=\\c!45, draw=\\c!70!black] (\\x,0.55) ellipse (1.05 and 1.2);", "    \\fill[\\c!70!black] (\\x-0.12,-0.68) -- (\\x+0.12,-0.68) -- (\\x,-0.55) -- cycle;", "    \\node[align=center] at (\\x,-1.65) {1 摩尔 \\g\\\\ \\qty{\\m}{g},", "      \\qty{24.1}{L}};", "  }", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}